# Gallery baselines: only the linux ones are a gate. CI renders on linux and
# compares against the committed linux files; the darwin copies were never
# read by anything, and committing both doubled the weight of every visual
# change (29 MB of the pack when we stopped). Regenerate them on demand with
# `pnpm --filter @nod/gallery shots:update` when you want a local check.
apps/gallery/e2e/*-snapshots/*-darwin.png

# Compiled ledger sidecar (scripts/build-ledger-sidecar.mjs); tauri-build
# resolves bundle.externalBin at compile time, so build it before cargo runs.
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/

# Stale pre-monorepo leftover at the repo root (contains a local .env and
# cargo artifacts); never stage it — the real crate lives in apps/desktop.
/src-tauri/
